      "description": "Any scrape target failing, anywhere. Non-zero here while an SLO panel reads No data is the explanation: the SLI is missing because the scrape is missing, not because the service is healthy. kind's etcd, scheduler, controller-manager and kube-proxy monitors are disabled in the chart values, so they should never appear in this count."
