      "title": "Node CPU utilisation",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "The application containers have no CPU limit, so contention shows up here as node saturation and in the services as latency, with no throttling metric in between. A latency burn with a saturated node is a capacity problem, not a code problem."
    },
