      "title": "Node root filesystem used",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Prometheus, Loki and Tempo all store on the node's disk here (emptyDir for Prometheus, local-path PVCs for Loki and Tempo), so this filling up takes the telemetry down before it takes the workloads down. mountpoint=\"/\" is the kind node's own filesystem \u2014 on a different node image the interesting mount may be elsewhere."
