          "legendFormat": "{{node}} \u00b7 Ready"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Node conditions",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Ready should sit at 1 for every node and the three pressure conditions at 0. A pressure condition going to 1 explains evictions and pod restarts that would otherwise look like application faults; Ready dropping is the node-drain scenario, and pods should reschedule rather than stay Pending because the topology spread constraints use ScheduleAnyway."
